                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly in the morning then tending south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 12 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
